 class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1473574#post1473574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nyx would be a good candidate</div> </div> </div> </div>Good point. As powerful as Zeus was, he didn't even pretend that he could face Nyx in a fight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T03:54:34-08:00","id":1474182,"title":"","content":"Well, a minor add I was thinking about was Art's History itself. We know that the World is much more diverse and less monotheistic than ours, but has it always been? If that was the case, then probably Reanascence art would be much less &quot;Christian themes with neo-classical skins&quot; and actual mythological scenes, mainly from the Theoi, of course, but maybe other pantheons could figure more in Western art as a whole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23841-hayashi","name":"Hayashi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23841_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T04:40:59-08:00","id":1474186,"title":"","content":"I honestly would not change much of the world in my game. There were always gods all around, just need to ask people, montains were raised by gods, walls and people too, you just dont believe in this myths.<br /> <br /> If all myths are true, Jesus is real (and have many mantles), as well as the several mantles of Judaic/Christian/Muslin god... better use God in this case because that is one of his proper names.<br /> <br /> A powerful God and their angels, prophets and fervorous followers would be capable of fight the gods and take followers, mantles, temples and everything from the other pantheons, to the point they are treated as false gods or mantles of the true ones. The Theoi did it to the Nemetondevos, its perfectly possible that one single god may try to do the same.<br /> <br /> I find it funny how people dont see their own beliefs as myths, &quot;Zeus is not real, but God is real&quot;. Even science (if you want to call it a atheistc belief system) is there to be questioned, its part of the scientific method, question, propose a better hypotesis and prove it, what is unquestionabel today will be left behind in 30 or even less years.<br /> <br /> Anyway, if you want to know how a politheistic world would look like, just look out of the window and check the people around you. There are more people that believe in polytheistic religions alive today than monotheistic. China, Japan, Korea, India, all the countries in Southeast Asia , most of Africa, the native population of Americas and Australia are all multi cultured and largely polytheistic, to them believing in a single god is as weird as believing there is none.<br /> <br /> Our &quot;christian&quot; culture has also many references to the cultures that our great great great... great parents had, Minerva is present is present in the symbol and paperwork of many engineering assosciations and univercities, same for the Caduceus, that is the symbol of Hermes (some times Asclepius). In Brazil, the largest catholic country in the world, every year we celebrate new years dressing as followers and making offerings to Iemanja.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T05:32:05-08:00","id":1474190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474186#post1474186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> same for the Caduceus, that is the symbol of Hermes (some times Asclepius).</div> </div> </div> </div>In our game, player Scion of Hermes is going around with literal, living Asceplius staff and healing people. As StoryGuide, I once mentioned by one NPC 'you are doctor with doctor staff symbol?' <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Our culture is very ''old god's infused' - For example, USA was born in neo-classical era, with American Revolution. Many symbols of it, especially on Dolar, are based on Masonery, that itself took many things and symbols from myths of Theoi and Netjar. Masons took a lot from hermtisicm tradtions of ancient world. That's why main god worshiped in this circles is <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hermes_Trismegistu\" target=\"_blank\">Hermes Trismegistus</a>, that is Mantle of Hermes AND Thoth, at the same time. And why there is Piramid in Iconography of USA dolar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T05:34:20-08:00","id":1474191,"title":"","content":"As to Abrahamic Religions One God in Scion World - we have fan projects notes on <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1363305-2e-pantheon-the-bodiless-powers-archangels\"><b>Bodiless Powers - Archangels Pantheon</b></a> - for this to work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T08:04:37-08:00","id":1474196,"title":"","content":"I disagree that the world would be the same as reality. Perhaps there are people in our world who have polytheistic faiths, but the Scion world is one where even the mostly-forgotten ir inactive ones are still active, because their Gods are also active. When was the last time you heard of a great superhuman hero doing some larger-than-life deed in the real world? Or saw tales that Mama Coca or Odin or Rangda had actually been seen? Why take a fantastic premise and bury it under &quot;everything is the same&quot;? Obviously, you can play it however you want, but it seems a shame to conceal the very fantastic elements that make Scion what it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5627-purple-snit","name":"Purple Snit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"309"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T08:44:25-08:00","id":1474200,"title":"","content":"I agree with you to a certain degree.<br /> <br /> One thing you may not get from my text is that you are supposing that heroes are all from old and dead cultures, but for sure there are Jesus Scions and God Scions and Alah Scions, all of them doing their own things. So there would be a lot of scions, like the ones in the Tora/Bible/Qoran doing their deeds and raising as saints and possible angels or whatever they do after they become more than demigods.<br /> <br /> You may find heroes capable of healing people, commanding lions to stay calm, living inside giant monsters in the ocean and things like that.<br /> <br /> Another thing, I said the gods os dead civilizarions were defeated by other gods, it means the civilizations that worship then abandoned them or were killed, so you may find still some people worshipping them, but its about the same number as in real world. It works in the the same way Scion dont say anything about the gods of the Neanderthals. Did they existed? Sure, all myths are true. Do they still exist? Maybe, as far as we know no, but they may be part of other pantheons, they may be titans of other panteons.<br /> <br /> Last but not least. If you go around asking people about other people doing fantastic stuff you will for sure hear some weird stuff, and we are talking about a society that greatly dont believe in miracles and will need prove to accept any, but if you go to some rural areas and isolated places you will hear some solid stories about modern wonders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T12:14:55-08:00","id":1474216,"title":"","content":"Comic books would have more mythic themes as would most popular literature. Mythic themes are already everywhere in popular culture. Heck I hear there's an RPG were you play Scions of the Gods ;-)<br /> <br /> But in universe, it would be vastly more common and not as limited to the Greeks with rare nods from the Norse and others. During WWI, there was a movement in America to write new operas based on Native American myths and themes. The only remnant of this movement is that Duh- da-da-da-duh they play to signal the presence of Native Americans in old Westerns ( that hook was probably composed by a Native American Opera singer).<br /> <br /> In the world, Native American deities of Beauty and Craft(Music) would have blessed these opera composers in order to both gain legend and respect. Getting their story out would be important.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T12:15:50-08:00","id":1474217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474200#post1474200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree with you to a certain degree.<br /> <br /> One thing you may not get from my text is that you are supposing that heroes are all from old and dead cultures, but for sure there are Jesus Scions and God Scions and Alah Scions, all of them doing their own things. So there would be a lot of scions, like the ones in the Tora/Bible/Qoran doing their deeds and raising as saints and possible angels or whatever they do after they become more than demigods.<br /> <br /> You may find heroes capable of healing people, commanding lions to stay calm, living inside giant monsters in the ocean and things like that.<br /> <br /> Another thing, I said the gods os dead civilizarions were defeated by other gods, it means the civilizations that worship then abandoned them or were killed, so you may find still some people worshipping them, but its about the same number as in real world. It works in the the same way Scion dont say anything about the gods of the Neanderthals. Did they existed? Sure, all myths are true. Do they still exist? Maybe, as far as we know no, but they may be part of other pantheons, they may be titans of other panteons.<br /> <br /> Last but not least. If you go around asking people about other people doing fantastic stuff you will for sure hear some weird stuff, and we are talking about a society that greatly dont believe in miracles and will need prove to accept any, but if you go to some rural areas and isolated places you will hear some solid stories about modern wonders.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really doubt that the number of people worshiping is going to be the same when in one situation worshipers get nothing and in another they demonstrably get divine favor for worshiping a 'dead god'. I also disagree with your assertion that them being defeated means the winners went so far as to completely and utterly genocide their followers or only stopped once they had lost something like 99.9% of their worshipers to death and disillusionment. Wars of complete and utter destruction like that are practically unheard of and certainly not the norm anywhere.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T12:24:59-08:00","id":1474221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474217#post1474217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I really doubt that the number of people worshiping is going to be the same when in one situation worshipers get nothing and in another they demonstrably get divine favor for worshiping a 'dead god'. I also disagree with your assertion that them being defeated means the winners went so far as to completely and utterly genocide their followers or only stopped once they had lost something like 99.9% of their worshipers to death and disillusionment. Wars of complete and utter destruction like that are practically unheard of and certainly not the norm anywhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why would God not source miracles to their followers? If we go &quot;all gods are true, all myths are true&quot; the preachers capable of granting peace and health to the followers would be real too. If all gods are true and all gods grant powers, God will be true and grant power to the followers. So an All might God would source all kind of might miracles to the followers.<br /> <br /> As far as I know only Scions get access to magic from the gods (according to Scion). All the known Scions of God (chosen or incarnations, or what ever you prefer to describe) have some powers, some predict stuff, others could bless people, others could heal people and the party favorite could multiply bread and turn water into buzz...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T12:55:25-08:00","id":1474222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474221#post1474221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would God not source miracles to their followers? If we go &quot;all gods are true, all myths are true&quot; the preachers capable of granting peace and health to the followers would be real too. If all gods are true and all gods grant powers, God will be true and grant power to the followers. So an All might God would source all kind of might miracles to the followers.<br /> <br /> As far as I know only Scions get access to magic from the gods (according to Scion). All the known Scions of God (chosen or incarnations, or what ever you prefer to describe) have some powers, some predict stuff, others could bless people, others could heal people and the party favorite could multiply bread and turn water into buzz...</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure they are still free to do things directly, they just have to be careful about it so they don't accidentally start a turf war or something just by the sheer level of power they have making everyone nervous about what such a powerful beings presence could mean. Easier to just send out the kids or another proxy supernatural creature of lesser power to give the blessing since their presence isn't such a big deal. And even if such a restriction did exist on what deities are allowed to do I don't see why you think the Abrahamic God would be given a pass by the rules of the setting. Because they have a ton of worshipers all over the world? So does the Hindu pantheon with its 1.2 billion adherents, hasn't helped them any in getting access to things other gods aren't allowed to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T16:52:57-08:00","id":1474240,"title":"","content":"My idea is based on what the Theoi did to Nemetondevos. It\u2019s not just about stealing followers, it\u2019s about stealing mantles and deleting gods.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T00:09:53-08:00","id":1474260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474240#post1474240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My idea is based on what the Theoi did to Nemetondevos. It\u2019s not just about stealing followers, it\u2019s about stealing mantles and deleting gods.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Theoi are massive dicks even by godly standards, and despite their extensive efforts it still didn't work and they have had to spend two thousand years stamping them out every time they rise back up lest they try to return the favor over taking it that far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T02:12:23-08:00","id":1474270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474260#post1474260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Theoi are massive dicks even by godly standards, and despite their extensive efforts it still didn't work and they have had to spend two thousand years stamping them out every time they rise back up lest they try to return the favor over taking it that far.</div> </div> </div> </div>And that's basically what The God have been doing since they come to power. The Theoi tried hard to put the Nemetondevos down, they could keep them down so far, God has been doing that in Europe for the last 1600 years.<br /> <br /> One of the commandments is exactly &quot;Do not worship anyone but me&quot;.<br /> Since middle ages it becomes illegal to be pagan (not illegal, but heavily prosecuted, and often punishable with death), what takes away the chance of new mantles being taken and suppress any Scion of the other gods from try to raise in power.<br /> God took many of the tittles usually used by the former gods, like Allfather, Sky Father, Guardian of the Souls of the Dead, Eternal one, among many. Not to mention the word god that he took as his name instead of a concept, basically he tried to stole the mantle of god, all gods, the concept of being a god.<br /> \u200bThe TDD are now faries<br /> The Theoi are Disney characters<br /> The Aesir are Marvel (Disney too) characters<br /> We treat all others as if they were crazy for believing in more than one god.<br /> <br /> We still dont know how Fatebound work for gods, but it really seams like they are far more limites by fatebinding than Heroes and Demigods (and Demigods are pretty locked in position by fate). I would guess a god must follow the conditions expected from them more often than not, so a god that is treated by the population as a fairy will show themself as a fairy to an entire population, uncapable of using his total powers. Thats how you could take a god power way from them when they are away from their believers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 02-09-2022, 05:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T05:32:39-08:00","id":1474281,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474240#post1474240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My idea is based on what the Theoi did to Nemetondevos. It\u2019s not just about stealing followers, it\u2019s about stealing mantles and deleting gods.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which would make culture a powerful tool. The Theoi are wrapped around a vast ocean of stories and artworks. You'd need to destroy most of the books in the world to erase the Theoi in the same way they erased the Nemetondevos. Thus every pantheon with an eye to its own security would want their story out there in the popular culture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T05:44:36-08:00","id":1474282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474281#post1474281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which would make culture a powerful tool. The Theoi are wrapped around a vast ocean of stories and artworks. You'd need to destroy most of the books in the world to erase the Theoi in the same way they erased the Nemetondevos. Thus every pantheon with an eye to its own security would want their story out there in the popular culture.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u00b4s the difficulty, the &quot;old gods&quot; are nothing more than old gods, false gods. That\u00b4s what happened in real world, the gods were turned into fairies, saints, etc, their symbols were turned into someone else symbols, their holydays becomes someone else holydays. In The World the same happend, but the meaning is that some of their mantels were stripped.<br /> <br /> Their cults and worship still exist, but its not as popular as you expect for real gods, because God is also real and very popular.<br /> <br /> I am not telling you guys that your World is wrong, I am telling you that our world is perfectly fine to be The World as is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 02-09-2022, 08:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T09:26:19-08:00","id":1474288,"title":"","content":"Then why play Scion? It's a game that is based on the premise that the older, polytheistic faiths are still vital and important in the world, and that their deities still actively grant power and influence to their Scions. That is pretty clearly not how it works in our own world (local legends of heroes and claims of &quot;faith healers&quot; aside). There hasn't been a tale of a Heracles, a Cu Cullain, or a Jesus in millennia. The game is about a world where the Aztec faith wasn't annihilated, where the Norse Gods are still commonplace in their lands, where the First Nations still have their religions. It's about heroes and myths, not our own mundane reality. It loses something if it's just &quot;reality but with Scions of God doing miracles.&quot; YMMV, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5627-purple-snit","name":"Purple Snit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"309"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T09:56:00-08:00","id":1474293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474282#post1474282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That\u00b4s the difficulty, the &quot;old gods&quot; are nothing more than old gods, false gods. That\u00b4s what happened in real world, the gods were turned into fairies, saints, etc, their symbols were turned into someone else symbols, their holydays becomes someone else holydays. In The World the same happend, but the meaning is that some of their mantels were stripped.<br /> <br /> Their cults and worship still exist, but its not as popular as you expect for real gods, because God is also real and very popular.<br /> <br /> I am not telling you guys that your World is wrong, I am telling you that our world is perfectly fine to be The World as is.</div> </div> </div> </div>You seem to be having trouble separating your real life views on reality from the way things are intended to be in the fictional reality of the game.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T15:58:21-08:00","id":1474333,"title":"","content":"Ok guys, I don\u2019t know how to play\u2026 sorry\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T16:58:35-08:00","id":1474335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474333#post1474333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok guys, I don\u2019t know how to play\u2026 sorry\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, if you want to house rules it at your table because that is what is fun for you then that is cool. It is just not how the baseline game setting assumes things work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-09T18:47:29-08:00","id":1474343,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Everyone please avoid personal attacks and real life accusations of posters or this thread will be shut down.</span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-10T02:47:09-08:00","id":1474358,"title":"","content":"Sorry for last night, I was stressed and got offended, but it's ok.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Purple Snit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472637-bit-of-fun-cultural-differences-the-scion-world?p=1474288#post1474288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then why play Scion? It's a game that is based on the premise that the older, polytheistic faiths are still vital and important in the world, and that their deities still actively grant power and influence to their Scions. That is pretty clearly not how it works in our own world (local legends of heroes and claims of &quot;faith healers&quot; aside). There hasn't been a tale of a Heracles, a Cu Cullain, or a Jesus in millennia. The game is about a world where the Aztec faith wasn't annihilated, where the Norse Gods are still commonplace in their lands, where the First Nations still have their religions. It's about heroes and myths, not our own mundane reality. It loses something if it's just &quot;reality but with Scions of God doing miracles.&quot; YMMV, of course.</div> </div> </div> </div>Answering your question.<br /> <br /> Just because its not a world full of mythical beings walking around all the time, it doens't mean its not a magical world. I like to think Heroes are not just powerful, they are unique, there are not that many of them and what they do is important,, even if they dont become gods, they are still known (as Heroes or as Urban Legends).<br /> <br /> A pretty mundane world, like ours, can be an awesome place to play as a Hero because they are unique.<br /> - They can be a select group of unique individuals fighting to bring back myths to a mundane world.<br /> - They can be the front end of a fight against a Titan that is removing all gods from history to become the only single God.<br /> - They can be the reincarnation of the old gods (like the Nemetondevos) after the pantheons were destroyed by God.<br /> - They can be all new gods after all the old ones disappeared (Part Time Gods idea)<br /> <br /> There are MANY different themes that can be played with Scion. The system is absolutely flexible and can cover all the way from a mundane to a very mythical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-10T23:37:36-08:00","id":1474418,"title":"","content":"I tend to have the various Pantheons represented as different temples and social organizations, with just enough oddities popping up that those paying attention will go 'Now, Wait a Minute...&quot;. for the Scions and Those in the know, I try to make it a world of Mystery and Wonder/Horror. We are dealing with Mythology here, not urban fantasy. Big difference","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-19T16:52:17-08:00","id":1475008,"title":"","content":"Other thoughts: In and America more overly influenced by the Greek/Roman Gods. I tend to have unified temples and Statuary around that I mention in passing to color that things are different than our world. <br /> <br /> For those in Political office, in the states I have a sort of loose Toga that is meant to go over a more modern suit for those in office. It's viewed a bit like wearing a cassock for judges anda symbol of office. The President wears a similar one, but a deep blue with white trim to signify who it is.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-19T19:46:02-08:00","id":1475015,"title":"","content":"Latin and Greek would still be taught in the public schools in such a world. Americans would be better at foreign languages and thus better at foreign policy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}